{"est_no":"167-27888","est_id":"8412","name":"Morning Star Mercantile Cafe","est_type":"Restaurant","address":"6141 Main St","city":"Salisbury","state":"IL","zip":"62677","visits":[{"id":"812297","date":"2026-09-09","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=812297&INSPECTION_NN=812297","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"737964","date":"2026-04-08","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=737964&INSPECTION_NN=737964","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"590127","date":"2025-09-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=590127&INSPECTION_NN=590127","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":51,"title":"Plumbing installed; proper backflow devices.","repeat":false,"comment":"There was a major leaking coming from the faucet handle of the kitchen’s handwashing sink. The PIC mentioned that a plumber will be to service the sink very soon. Ensure that faucet handles are maintained in good repair and always in a leak free condition.","citation":"5-205.15(B)","citation_text":"5-205.15(B) System Maintained in Good Repair. A plumbing system shall be: (B) Maintained in good repair."}]},{"id":"543175","date":"2025-04-23","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=543175&INSPECTION_NN=543175","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":15,"title":"Food separated and protected.","repeat":false,"comment":"The PIC was observed handling food with gloved hands and then touching the handle of the paper towel dispenser. The PIC then proceeded to handle food. Discussed proper glove use with PIC. If tasks are interrupted during food handling, be sure to always change gloves and wash hands before doing so to prevent contaminating food.","citation":"3-304.15(A)","citation_text":"3-304.15(A) Gloves, Use Limitation. (A) If used, single-use gloves shall be used for only one task such as working with ready-to-eat food or with raw animal food, used for no other purpose, and discarded when damaged or soiled, or when interruptions occur in the operation."}]},{"id":"520270","date":"2024-10-09","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=520270&INSPECTION_NN=520270","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"505538","date":"2024-06-13","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=505538&INSPECTION_NN=505538","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"498302","date":"2024-04-17","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=498302&INSPECTION_NN=498302","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"475618","date":"2023-09-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=475618&INSPECTION_NN=475618","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"470787","date":"2023-08-21","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=470787&INSPECTION_NN=470787","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"462662","date":"2023-07-03","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=462662&INSPECTION_NN=462662","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"457291","date":"2023-05-17","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":2,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=457291&INSPECTION_NN=457291","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":2,"title":"Certified Food Protection Manager (CFPM)","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"2-102.12","citation_text":"2-102.12 PIC has an expired food manager certification and is in the process of renewing. See additional comments for additional information.\nPerson in charge at the time of inspection shall be a certified food protection manager who has shown proficiency of required information through passing a test that is part of an accredited program."},{"item":3,"title":"Management, food employee and conditional employee; knowledge, responsibilities and reporting","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"2-103.11","citation_text":"2-103.11 (O) Signed copies of employee health reporting agreements were not available for owner or staff working at the time of inspection. Employee health documents were provided and discussed, including reporting agreements, which were signed at the time of inspection. Additional copies of reporting agreement were left for owner to have other part time staff review and sign. Ensure all staff are educated on the employee health policy upon hiring and sign reporting agreements prior to beginning their first shift. Maintain signed copies of reporting agreements for staff.\nThe person in charge shall ensure that food employees are informed in a verifiable manner of their responsibility to report in accordance with law, to the person in charge, information about their health and activities as they relate to diseases that are transmissible through food, as specified under  2-201.11(A)."},{"item":58,"title":"Allergen training as required","repeat":false,"comment":"410 ILCS 625 Sec. 3.07 Owner has an allergen certification that expired as of April 2023. Requirements for allergen training were discussed. Ensure food allergen certification is completed by the next routine inspection\nUnless otherwise provided, all certified food service sanitation managers employed by a restaurant must receive or obtain training in basic allergen awareness principles within 30 days after employment and every 3 years thereafter.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"426010","date":"2022-08-03","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=426010&INSPECTION_NN=426010","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"415422","date":"2022-04-15","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8412&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=